Architecture Overview
Source Code → GitHub/GitLab

CI/CD Pipeline → CodePipeline / Jenkins / GitHub Actions

Image Build → AWS CodeBuild (Docker-in-Docker isolated environment, no Docker on EC2)

Image Registry → Amazon ECR

Cluster Infra → Amazon EKS provisioned via Terraform

Deployment → Helm charts applied to EKS

Networking → ALB Ingress Controller, VPC, Subnets, NAT Gateway

Scaling & Monitoring → HPA (Horizontal Pod Autoscaler), CloudWatch, Prometheus/Grafana